flowchart TD
  A[Entry] --> B{Content available?}
  B -->|Yes| C[View primary content]
  B -->|No| D[Show empty guidance]
  C --> E[Choose action]
  E --> F[Complete fields]
  F --> G{Input valid?}
  G -->|No| H[Show inline correction]
  H --> F
  G -->|Yes| I[Preview result]
  I --> J{Confirm?}
  J -->|No| F
  J -->|Yes| K[Show completion state]
  K --> L[Offer next relevant action]
Rationale: context, correction, preview, confirmation, and completion remain distinct.
Quality gates: every branch is recoverable; no destructive action is implicit; confirmation is specific; completion and interruption states are visible.
Publishing rule: flow labels and identifiers remain stable after publication; revisions include date, reason, and affected artifact.